5,1,1,talk,Mio,,I’m so excited to finally pick our next big show! I just want to make sure we don’t get blindsided by surprise costs later.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I’m less concerned about the show itself and more about who will actually be left to run it once the opening day arrives.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,"The record should speak before we commit. I want to know what audiences actually returned for, not what we thought was impressive.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,The building itself is a constraint. I need to know what the floor and structure can actually absorb before we promise the space to anyone.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I worry about the deliveries. We’ve approved things in good faith, only to spend the season apologising at the door.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Victoria, that’s a fair point. I’m picking loan transport costs and mount-making charges to see where the money actually goes.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,I’ll check conservation lab staffing and the volunteer roster. We need to know who is actually available to handle the workload.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shion,,"I’ll review the weekend head counts and the visitor comment slips. The data will show what truly drives return visits, not our assumptions.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Asuka,,I’ll look into the structural survey of the suspended bay and the maintenance log for powered displays.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I’ll check the lender paperwork against shipping cut-offs and the evening hire bookings. I need to see where the schedule actually breaks down.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,#### Turn 3 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"- **Victoria**: @Mio, I hope those invoices are as clear as you hope. I’ll be watching the staffing numbers closely.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shion,,#### Turn 3 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"- **Asuka**: @Shizue, the evening hire bookings might explain some of the structural wear I’m seeing in the logs.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"- **Shizue**: @Asuka, that is a sharp observation. I will see if the hire dates align with the structural notes you mentioned.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,"@Shion, I hope the head counts back up my hunch that interactive stuff keeps people coming back. Let’s see what the numbers say!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Mio"",""self"":true,""raw"":""**Mio**: @Shion, I hope the head counts back up my hunch that interactive stuff keeps people coming back. Let’s see what the numbers say!""}]}"
21,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I’ll be reviewing the staffing gaps carefully. We cannot promise a season we cannot staff.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shion,,- **Shion**: The data will be unambiguous. I will present the findings without embellishment.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Asuka,,- **Asuka**: Agreed. I will cross-reference the hire dates with the structural survey to confirm the load limits.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shizue,,- **Shizue**: I will trace the paperwork delays against the hire dates. We must know exactly where the schedule snapped.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
