35,2,1,talk,Mio,,#### Turn 1 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"- **Mio**: I found that transport costs are huge, but making our own mounts is even pricier. We need to be careful with what we commission.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shion,,- **Victoria**: The lab is down to one person with two hundred pieces waiting. We simply cannot absorb another heavy conservation load.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Asuka,,- **Shion**: The head counts confirm it: mechanisms and changing displays drive returns. Static cases lose them.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shizue,,- **Shizue**: The paperwork delays align perfectly with the hire dates. We are double-booking the gallery and the couriers.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"- **Mio**: @Victoria, that backlog is terrifying. If we pick something needing heavy conservation, we’re stuck. I’m glad I checked the costs.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, exactly. With one conservator and that backlog, we cannot risk a show requiring intensive stabilization. We must choose something manageable.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shion,,"- **Shion**: @Mio, your cost data aligns with my findings. We need a show that is self-sufficient and dynamic, not one that drains our limited resources.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"- **Asuka**: @Shion, dynamic implies powered. My maintenance log shows seventeen call-outs, four during opening hours. That is a liability, not a feature.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"- **Shizue**: @Asuka, that is a serious warning. If the powered displays fail, we cannot afford the downtime. We must weigh that risk carefully.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,"- **Mio**: @Asuka, that’s a lot of repairs! I’m worried about the budget if we pick something that needs constant fixing.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, the staffing gap is just as critical. We cannot rely on volunteers to fix broken mechanisms. We need a show that runs on its own.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, your maintenance log is a valid constraint. However, the head counts prove that static displays fail to retain audiences. We need a balance.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, a balance is impossible if the bay fails. I need to know the specific load limits before we discuss any rigging.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Asuka, I will check if the heavy stonework deliveries clashed with the evening hires. We must avoid that bottleneck again.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,"@Shion, I hear you, but if the bay can’t hold the weight, the show is over before it starts. Let’s prioritize safety first!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, safety is non-negotiable, but so is staffing. We cannot risk a show that requires constant manual intervention from an exhausted team.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shion,,"@Mio, safety is a constraint, not a preference. I will not compromise on audience retention for the sake of caution.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, caution is not a preference; it is physics. If the bay fails, there is no audience to retain.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"@Asuka, you are right. Physics does not negotiate. I will ensure the delivery schedule respects those limits, so we do not repeat last season’s apologies.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
