60,3,1,talk,Mio,,"- **Mio**: Okay, candidates are here! I’m leaning toward the textiles show. It feels lively with the demonstrations, and hopefully cheaper to install than big loans!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"- **Victoria**: @Mio, the demonstrations require staff presence. With our current backlog, I worry we lack the hands to keep them running safely.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Shion,,"- **Shion**: @Mio, the comment slips are explicit: people return because someone is present and talking. Textiles offers exactly that, without the mechanical risk.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"- **Asuka**: @Mio, the textiles are light. No overhead rigging, no heavy stonework. The bay stays clear, and the floor handles the weight easily.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"- **Shizue**: @Mio, I agree. Local loans mean no distant paperwork delays. We can open on time and keep the gallery clear for evening hires.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Mio,,"- **Mio**: @Shion, you’re right! The interviews and demos mean people are actually there, not just looking at empty cases. I’m really excited about this one!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"- **Victoria**: @Mio, the craftspeople are external. They do not add to our internal conservation backlog. I can accept this, provided the roster covers the floor.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Shion,,"- **Shion**: @Victoria, the town history circle is already guiding walks. They can manage the floor without straining the lab. The data supports this.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"- **Asuka**: @Shion, the town history circle is a good fit. They know the local context, and the light load keeps the structure safe.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"- **Shizue**: @Shion, that is a wise use of our existing volunteers. It keeps the schedule tight and the doors open without delay.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Mio,,"- **Mio**: I’m voting for Textiles! It checks every box: lively, safe, and no scary invoices. Who else is with me?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Victoria,,- **Victoria**: I am voting for Textiles. It respects our staffing limits and avoids the structural risks we cannot afford.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Shion,,"- **Shion**: I vote for Textiles. The data confirms presence drives returns, and this avoids the mechanical failures that plagued previous seasons.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Asuka,,"- **Asuka**: I vote for Textiles. The load is minimal, the structure is safe, and the schedule remains viable.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"- **Shizue**: I vote for Textiles. Local sources mean no distant paperwork delays, and the schedule stays clear for our evening hires.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Mio,,- **Mio**: Five votes! Textiles of the Region it is! I can’t wait to see the craftspeople in action!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Victoria,,"- **Victoria**: Agreed. A safe, staffable season is the only one we can actually deliver.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Shion,,- **Shion**: The record is satisfied. Textiles of the Region is selected.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Asuka,,- **Asuka**: The structure is secure. We are ready to proceed.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Shizue,,- **Shizue**: And the doors will stay open on time. I am glad we chose a season we can actually keep.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
